<h2>Key Takeaways</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Anthropic is now the highest-revenue AI lab.</strong> $30B run =
rate vs. OpenAI's $24B. Enterprise demand =E2=80=94 not consumer =E2=80=94 =
drove it. If you're building on Claude, you're betting on the market leader=
.</li>
<li><strong>Meta killed open-source AI's biggest champion.</strong> Muse Sp=
ark is closed. The hybrid strategy means open-source gets the scraps; the b=
est models stay locked. Developers who built on Llama's openness need a Pla=
n B.</li>
<li><strong>OpenAI's IPO is in real trouble.</strong> When your own CFO say=
s the timeline is too aggressive and gets excluded from meetings for saying=
